	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Name = `01. Airspace Message & Temporality-Note01AirspaceMessage`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note01AirspaceMessage`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Body = `01. Airspace Message & Temporality Story

An [models.AIXMBasicMessage] is the root exchange container that groups aeronautical features via [models.BasicMessageMemberAIXMPropertyType].
Every AIXM feature ([models.AirspaceType], [models.GeoBorderType]) follows the Temporality Model: its state over time is represented
by [models.AirspaceTimeSliceType] slices (BASELINE, PERMDELTA, TEMPDELTA, SNAPSHOT) bounded by ValidTime ([models.TimePrimitivePropertyType]).
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.BodyHTML = `<p>01. Airspace Message &amp; Temporality Story
<p>An <a href="/models#AIXMBasicMessage">models.AIXMBasicMessage</a> is the root exchange container that groups aeronautical features via <a href="/models#BasicMessageMemberAIXMPropertyType">models.BasicMessageMemberAIXMPropertyType</a>.
Every AIXM feature (<a href="/models#AirspaceType">models.AirspaceType</a>, <a href="/models#GeoBorderType">models.GeoBorderType</a>) follows the Temporality Model: its state over time is represented
by <a href="/models#AirspaceTimeSliceType">models.AirspaceTimeSliceType</a> slices (BASELINE, PERMDELTA, TEMPDELTA, SNAPSHOT) bounded by ValidTime (<a href="/models#TimePrimitivePropertyType">models.TimePrimitivePropertyType</a>).
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Height = 142.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.IsHidden = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Matched = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.IsExpanded = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Name = `02. Airspace & Geometry Volumes-Note02AirspaceVolumes`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note02AirspaceVolumes`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Body = `02. Airspace & Geometry Volumes Story

An [models.AirspaceTimeSliceType] defines its 3D spatial extent through one or more [models.AirspaceGeometryComponentType] blocks.
Each component references an [models.AirspaceVolumeType] bounded vertically by upper/lower limits and horizontally by a
projected [models.SurfaceType] or derived from another airspace via [models.AirspaceVolumeDependencyType].
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.BodyHTML = `<p>02. Airspace &amp; Geometry Volumes Story
<p>An <a href="/models#AirspaceTimeSliceType">models.AirspaceTimeSliceType</a> defines its 3D spatial extent through one or more <a href="/models#AirspaceGeometryComponentType">models.AirspaceGeometryComponentType</a> blocks.
Each component references an <a href="/models#AirspaceVolumeType">models.AirspaceVolumeType</a> bounded vertically by upper/lower limits and horizontally by a
projected <a href="/models#SurfaceType">models.SurfaceType</a> or derived from another airspace via <a href="/models#AirspaceVolumeDependencyType">models.AirspaceVolumeDependencyType</a>.
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Height = 142.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.IsHidden = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Matched = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.IsExpanded = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Name = `03. Airspace Activation & Layer Classification-Note03AirspaceActivation`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note03AirspaceActivation`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Body = `03. Airspace Activation & Layer Classification Story

Dynamic airspace status is modeled on [models.AirspaceTimeSliceType] via [models.AirspaceActivationType] (status, activity, levels, and [models.TimesheetType] schedules).
ICAO airspace class (A through G) per altitude band is defined by [models.AirspaceLayerClassType] and vertical [models.AirspaceLayerType] slices.
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.BodyHTML = `<p>03. Airspace Activation &amp; Layer Classification Story
<p>Dynamic airspace status is modeled on <a href="/models#AirspaceTimeSliceType">models.AirspaceTimeSliceType</a> via <a href="/models#AirspaceActivationType">models.AirspaceActivationType</a> (status, activity, levels, and <a href="/models#TimesheetType">models.TimesheetType</a> schedules).
ICAO airspace class (A through G) per altitude band is defined by <a href="/models#AirspaceLayerClassType">models.AirspaceLayerClassType</a> and vertical <a href="/models#AirspaceLayerType">models.AirspaceLayerType</a> slices.
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Height = 124.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.IsHidden = false
